  "question": {
    "html": "<p>An object moves in a circle of constant radius. Values of the centripetal force <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> are measured for different values of angular velocity <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\omega\"></span>. A graph is plotted with <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\omega\"></span> on the <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span>-axis. Which quantity plotted on the <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"y\"></span>-axis will produce a straight-line graph?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{F}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F^{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{F}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
